{"id":"vod_lz_33035","vodId":"33035","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"攻壳机动队第二季","name_cn":"攻壳机动队第二季","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220906-1/56f18c718f7b47e93f0983d157011acf.jpg"},"summary":"　　《攻壳机动队SAC 2nd GIG》是根据士郎正宗漫画原作改编的第二季日本动画影集。　　2004年1月1日于日本SKY电视播映。每集制作费高达3000万日元。　　共26话。　　故事内容延续第一部TV版攻壳机动队STAND ALONE COMPLEX的剧情继续发展。但TV版的2部作品与剧场版无甚联系，可以看做是两个平行世界里发生的事情。　　这次TV版第2季的制作班底与第一部相同，同时剧情表达上和第一季一样，每话由不同故事构成，各自独立成章，却贯穿着同一条主线。在剧情上同时电影版导演押井守也参与了协力，不过电影版中凄凉的气氛没有在TV版第二季中体现。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"动作,科幻,动画,惊悚,犯罪"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-09-06 01:41:15","classic":true,"classicRank":13,"franchise":"攻壳机动队","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220904/31468_3a76eb0b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220904/31469_3aed06cf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220904/31470_67d99e90/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220904/31471_9e49a4bd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220904/31472_c3bbad05/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220904/31474_34fd7279/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220904/31473_ea6240ff/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220904/31477_c908faab/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220904/31475_7a5c3355/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220904/31476_f3e0003c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220904/31478_093f4f8a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220904/31479_8a433ed9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220904/31480_b953db74/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn.com/20220904/31481_2a